LUMA SUMMARY:
QS 5.4 handshake-state anomaly. Cozmo finds the handshake text still physically sitting in GPT's UI even though QS considers the node connected. The session investigates whether the protocol handshake has actually become unnecessary or whether the relay state and UI state have simply diverged.</summary>
